flowchart LR
    CAP[Application capture] --> VIEW[AudioView]
    VIEW --> MAP[Input channel mapping]
    MAP --> STFT[ODAS STFT]
    STFT --> SSL[ODAS SSL]
    SSL --> SST[ODAS SST]
    STFT --> SSS[ODAS SSS]
    SST -->|fixed track slots| SSS
    SSS --> ISTFT[ODAS ISTFT]
    SST --> TRACK[SpatialTrack]
    ISTFT --> FRAME[TrackedAudioFrame]
